<trans-unit id="languages_help"><source>kanka_notices.languages_help</source><target>Languages are discovered from customers and invoice templates. Configured translations remain available. You can add another language below. Adding or reordering blocks does not save the profile; use Save profile when finished. Translations are not generated automatically.</target></trans-unit>
<trans-unit id="language_sources"><source>kanka_notices.language_sources</source><target>Customers: %customers% · Invoice templates: %templates% · Profiles with text: %profiles%</target></trans-unit>
<trans-unit id="enable_translation"><source>kanka_notices.enable_translation</source><target>You entered text for this language. Enable the translation or clear its text before saving; entered text will not be silently discarded.</target></trans-unit>
