<trans-unit id="profile_unavailable"><source>kanka_notices.profile_unavailable</source><target>The selected notice profile is missing or its configuration is invalid. Ask an administrator to check Invoice Notices or choose another profile for this export.</target></trans-unit>
<trans-unit id="profile_inactive"><source>kanka_notices.profile_inactive</source><target>Notice profile “%name%” is inactive. Reactivate it in Invoice Notices or select another profile for this export.</target></trans-unit>
<trans-unit id="translation_missing"><source>kanka_notices.translation_missing</source><target>Notice profile “%name%” has no enabled translation for document language %language%. Add that translation in Invoice Notices or select an appropriate profile for this export.</target></trans-unit>
<trans-unit id="snapshot_immutable"><source>kanka_notices.snapshot_immutable</source><target>The notices saved with this invoice cannot be changed. Create a corrected invoice through your normal accounting workflow.</target></trans-unit>
